from cp23b.replay
# Event branch m6-event-regi-iron (docs/decisions.md: the dev-only event flag;
# docs/research/postgame.md §6): `event regigigas` gives a fateful Regigigas (My Pokémon Ranch's, L100), the gate of the
# three ruins (check_party_has_fateful_encounter_regigigas; a plain Regigigas is not enough). From cp23b's end (Snowpoint
# Temple opened on the chain). Kept setup: the event, two more Master Balls, the warp into the Iron Ruins (Iron Island
# B3F, off the chain): the seven dots of sys-regi-ruins-dots activate the statue (RUINS_STATE_ACTIVATED_STATUE
# 270); A on the statue: Registeel's L30 battle, caught: state RUINS_STATE_CAUGHT_REGI (290), Registeel to the PC (the
# party is full). m6-event-regi-rock and -ice chain on.
event regigigas
give item platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 2
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_IRON_RUINS 7 11 up
until idle
